    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/a436daef6efb2f27a108e1eab620a0d9.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome back to the world of Kaz's Adventure, after Kaz meets with a terrible fate, he goes looking to reunite with his long lost brother as he adventures through the vast underworld!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/46a9e2780e52f9d228cbf7a859261331.poster.avif?t=1752436206\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/46a9e2780e52f9d228cbf7a859261331.webm?t=1752436206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/46a9e2780e52f9d228cbf7a859261331.mp4?t=1752436206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/5e4862ada9fe8ff642c74903df3b869b.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kaz's Adventure 2 uses hand drawn, cartoon styled, 2D graphics compared to the first games pixel art style!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/c14c066baa8eaa8223f952889a3a1335.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/953d742a547abf0fc91879b159169dc5.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kaz gains a new ability during the story which allows him to do a short dash forward which allows for a faster paced and more risky adventure!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/21c218b32e985c9668329a57a2e12759.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/0f09a9a45d79cdaca433f0985345bb04.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Editor 2.0 is instantly unlocked when you startup the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game also comes with 2 other new bonus modes for players to enjoy once unlocked by collecting 15 or 30 Soul Orbs, you may unlock the modes before or after the story is complete, one of the new modes is the survival mode where players must survive as long as possible on a small platform as the returning enemy: &quot;Cloaked&quot;, constantly float towards you, the theme will change each attempt you do to reflect the different world environments within the story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/c62f83f727b4be51857411d56b279920.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/a436daef6efb2f27a108e1eab620a0d9.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome back to the world of Kaz's Adventure, after Kaz meets with a terrible fate, he goes looking to reunite with his long lost brother as he adventures through the vast underworld!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/46a9e2780e52f9d228cbf7a859261331.poster.avif?t=1752436206\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/46a9e2780e52f9d228cbf7a859261331.webm?t=1752436206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/46a9e2780e52f9d228cbf7a859261331.mp4?t=1752436206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/5e4862ada9fe8ff642c74903df3b869b.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kaz's Adventure 2 uses hand drawn, cartoon styled, 2D graphics compared to the first games pixel art style!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/c14c066baa8eaa8223f952889a3a1335.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/953d742a547abf0fc91879b159169dc5.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kaz gains a new ability during the story which allows him to do a short dash forward which allows for a faster paced and more risky adventure!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/21c218b32e985c9668329a57a2e12759.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/0f09a9a45d79cdaca433f0985345bb04.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Editor 2.0 is instantly unlocked when you startup the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game also comes with 2 other new bonus modes for players to enjoy once unlocked by collecting 15 or 30 Soul Orbs, you may unlock the modes before or after the story is complete, one of the new modes is the survival mode where players must survive as long as possible on a small platform as the returning enemy: &quot;Cloaked&quot;, constantly float towards you, the theme will change each attempt you do to reflect the different world environments within the story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147030/extras/c62f83f727b4be51857411d56b279920.avif?t=1752436206\" /></div></p>",
